WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.286
These four words appear often in Spark A partition
is a chunk of distributed

00:00:06.312 --> 00:00:11.815
data A task is a unit of work that runs on an
executor A

00:00:11.841 --> 00:00:15.644
stage is a group of tasks that can run before a new
exchange is needed

00:00:17.491 --> 00:00:23.204
A shuffle is the movement of data across workers
Shuffles often matter for performance

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:25.480
because they require network and disk work
